cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you reference this theorem, paper, or formalization, please cite it as below."
title: "Singular points of klt del Pezzo surfaces of Picard number one in positive characteristic"
version: 1.0.0
authors:
  - family-names: "Turturean"
    given-names: "David"
    email: "davidct@mit.edu"
date-released: 2026-09-17
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/davidturturean/klt-del-pezzo"
abstract: >-
  Over an algebraically closed field of characteristic p > 2, a klt del Pezzo
  surface of Picard number one has at most seven singular points. The bound is
  sharp in characteristic three and fails in characteristic two. This repository
  contains the paper and a complete Lean 4 formalization of the theorem and of
  the examples, compiling against Lean 4.19.0 and Mathlib c44e0c8.
keywords:
  - "del Pezzo surface"
  - "klt singularities"
  - "positive characteristic"
  - "Lean 4"
  - "formal verification"
  - "Mathlib"
